|---|---|---|
| `src/facade/cli` | `src/cli` | "facade" hides that this is the product command tree. |
| `src/services/invocation_transport` | `src/invocation` | This is the daemon Invocation adapter plane, not a generic service bag. |
| `src/services/{keyring,self_identity,trust_*}` | `src/identity` | Identity/trust state is a coherent daemon domain. |
| `src/services/federation_directory` + resolver pieces | `src/directory` | Directory/cache/resolution should become DNS-like and explicit. |
| `src/runtime/execution/*` | `src/execution/*` | Execution adapters are implementation backends, not the runtime identity model. |
| `src/runtime/agents/*` | `src/agents/*` plus `src/abilities/*` | Agent lifecycle and ability implementations are different domains. |
| `src/runtime/plugin_host` + `src/plugins` | `src/plugins` | One plugin ownership tree, with builtin and sidecar submodules. |
| `src/support/*` | Keep only platform helpers; move domain helpers out. | Prevent support from becoming a dumping ground. |

